0000-0082 FIN
```

## 🤝 Contributing
Contributions to expand the custom instruction set or enhance parsing algorithms are welcome! 
*   Always validate dynamic memory allocations (`malloc` returns) to avoid runtime segmentation faults.
*   Avoid mixing `signed` and `unsigned` operands inside conditional evaluations to prevent unexpected sign-change warnings.

